 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 2.036,
   "text": "Imagine waking up tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.036,
   "end": 4.687,
   "text": "and finding out everyone in your city"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 4.687,
   "end": 6.686,
   "text": "wants to take all their money out of the bank."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 6.886,
   "end": 7.761,
   "text": "What would happen?"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.0,
   "end": 11.024,
   "text": "Here's the secret."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 11.224,
   "end": 13.347,
   "text": "Banks don't keep every dollar you deposit"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 13.347,
   "end": 14.552,
   "text": "sitting in a vault."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 14.752,
   "end": 17.376,
   "text": "They use much of that money to make loans,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 17.376,
   "end": 19.659,
   "text": "like helping people buy homes and cars."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 20.079,
   "end": 22.588,
   "text": "But what if everyone wanted their money back"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 22.588,
   "end": 23.663,
   "text": "at the exact same time?"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 23.863,
   "end": 25.773,
   "text": "The bank might not have enough cash ready"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 25.773,
   "end": 27.532,
   "text": "to give everyone immediately!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 29.0,
   "end": 30.387,
   "text": "This is called a bank run."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 30.587,
   "end": 33.173,
   "text": "If the bank has to sell things quickly to get cash,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 33.173,
   "end": 34.491,
   "text": "it could lose money."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 34.691,
   "end": 36.419,
   "text": "And panic could spread to other banks!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 36.839,
   "end": 38.097,
   "text": "But here's the good news!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 38.297,
   "end": 42.834,
   "text": "In the United States, the FDIC protects eligible bank deposits"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 42.834,
   "end": 46.396,
   "text": "up to $250,000 per depositor,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 46.396,
   "end": 49.135,
   "text": "per insured bank, per ownership category."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 49.555,
   "end": 51.777,
   "text": "So banks work because not everyone"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 51.777,
   "end": 53.309,
   "text": "needs all their money at once."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 53.509,
   "end": 55.856,
   "text": "That's why banks manage cash carefully"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 55.856,
   "end": 57.115,
   "text": "and have safety systems."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 57.315,
   "end": 58.851,
   "text": "Would you keep your money in a bank?"
  }
 ]
}